{"id":"n88405-1-11","stage":2,"title":"휴가철 · 休假季","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88405-1-11-1","ko":"휴가철인데 어디 여행이라도 안 가세요?","zh":"现在是假期，您不打算去哪儿旅行吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"휴가철인데","meaning":"休假季，休假期","explanation":"휴가철：休假季，休假期；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"휴가철","audio":"/audio/009d74e588ba92a0d08e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88405","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴가철","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디","meaning":"一个地方","explanation":"어디：一个地方","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"2","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여행이라도","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；이라도：退而求其次地举出选择，或表示“哪怕、即使”。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가세요?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"009d74e588ba92a0","term":"휴가철","zh":"休假季，休假期","audio":"/audio/009d74e588ba92a0d08e.mp3","entryId":"88405","definition":"许多人度假的时间。","pronunciation":["휴가철"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"一个地方","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代没有向听话人表明的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不